<title>UK: Alliance says not discussing Nationwide bid.</title>
<headline>Alliance says not discussing Nationwide bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recently floated bank Alliance &amp; Leicester Plc said on Tuesday it was not discussing a merger with or a bid for Britain's largest building society, the Nationwide.</p>
<p>Nationwide will later announce the result of elections to its board which are being contested by a group that wants to force the Society to give up its mutual status and press reports have speculated that Alliance &amp; Leicester might launch a bid.</p>
</text>
